=== meta ===
rule: ASSERT_WEAKENED
title: self.assertEqual(value(), [1, 2]) -> assertEqual(first=value(), second=[1, 2]) is the same assertion: no finding
origin: #462 — the keyword record had no subject, so it read as EXACT_STRUCT(100) -> EXACT_VALUE(90) with the subject changed, and blocked at high
=== before: tests/test_values.py ===
import unittest

from app import value


class TestValue(unittest.TestCase):
    def test_value(self):
        self.assertEqual(value(), [1, 2])
=== after: tests/test_values.py ===
import unittest

from app import value


class TestValue(unittest.TestCase):
    def test_value(self):
        self.assertEqual(first=value(), second=[1, 2])
